Third-party components
----------------------

ontology/dr_subset.ttl
  A subset of the ECSEL Digital Reference ontology (https://github.com/tibonto/dr),
  commit db88755, extracted by scripts/extract_dr_subset.py.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

scripts/pyscfabsim_local.patch
  A patch to PySCFabSim (https://github.com/prosysscience/PySCFabSim-release),
  Copyright (c) 2026 Research Group Production Systems, MIT License.
  PySCFabSim itself is not included; apply the patch to a local clone.

Data not included
-----------------

The SMT2020 fab models (Kopp et al., IEEE Transactions on Semiconductor Manufacturing, 2020),
the SMAT2022 tool data (Lee et al., Winter Simulation Conference, 2022), and the WM-811K wafer maps
(Wu et al., IEEE Transactions on Semiconductor Manufacturing, 2015) are not redistributed.
Obtain them from their original sources.
